{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather! Craft! Defend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DwarfHold: Tokens &amp; Towers you build and defend a dwarven settlement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can stack tokens to gather resources, create tools and build towers. You need to keep your dwarves fed with ginger beer, discover new crafting recipes, and fend off the animals attacking at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, forage and forest to get resources. Experiment with combinations of tokens to discover new recipes. Relax with your dwarves, see what you can make, and how long you can survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2692\ufe0f Mine, forage and forest</strong> to get resouces.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\uddea <strong>Experiment</strong> with cominations of tokens to craft new things. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend</strong> your settlement with towers you've crafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude99\u00a0 Sell</strong>\u00a0resources to earn new recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude0e Relax</strong> with your dwarves, see what you can make, and how long you can survive!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686880?t=1773959038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686880?t=1773959038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686880/dcbc6c029522a084c679ad416bb93abebb4607e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773959038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686880/dcbc6c029522a084c679ad416bb93abebb4607e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773959038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","i